{"pageid": 924, "title": "Becca", "revid": 2178, "categories": ["Characters", "Humans", "Children", "Deceased", "Characters (SIKTC comics)"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">Becca</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/c/c1/Becca.png/revision/latest?cb=20241229032547\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Becca\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/c/c1/Becca.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/267?cb=20241229032547\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/c/c1/Becca.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/267?cb=20241229032547 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/c/c1/Becca.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/535?cb=20241229032547 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Becca\" width=\"270\" height=\"183\" data-image-key=\"Becca.png\" data-image-name=\"Becca.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Biographical Information</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"species\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Species</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Human</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Deceased\" title=\"Category:Deceased\">Deceased</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"cause_of_death\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Cause of Death</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Ripped in half by <a href=\"/wiki/Octo\" title=\"Octo\">Octo</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Appearances</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"first_appearance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">First Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_16\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 16\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> 16</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"last_appearance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Last Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_19\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 19\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> 19</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<blockquote class=\"pull-quote\">\n\t<div class=\"pull-quote&#95;&#95;text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Erica_Slaughter\" title=\"Erica Slaughter\">Erica</a>? Don't let it get me! <i>Please don't let it get me!'</i></div>\n\t<p style=\"text-align: right\"><cite>—Becca to <a href=\"/wiki/Erica_Slaughter\" title=\"Erica Slaughter\">Erica Slaughter</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_16\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 16\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #16</a></cite></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><b>Becca</b> was a young girl who lived nearby and was best friends with a girl named <a href=\"/wiki/Erica_Slaughter\" title=\"Erica Slaughter\">Erica</a>. During a sleepover c. 2000, Becca was killed by a vicious <a href=\"/wiki/Oscuratypes\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Oscuratypes\">Oscuratype</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Monsters\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Monsters\">monster</a> which would later <a href=\"/wiki/Totems\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Totems\">be bound to</a> Erica as <a href=\"/wiki/Octo\" title=\"Octo\">Octo</a>.\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span></h2>\n<p>Little is known about Becca, due to how little <a href=\"/wiki/Erica_Slaughter\" title=\"Erica Slaughter\">Erica Slaughter</a> talks about her. She was a girl about Erica's age who was her best friend during her pre-<a href=\"/wiki/The_Order_of_St._George\" title=\"The Order of St. George\">Order</a> life. The two girls were having a sleepover while Erica's parents went out to get them pizza,<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC17&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC17-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> leaving them alone. An <a href=\"/wiki/Oscuratypes\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Oscuratypes\">Oscuratype</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Monsters\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Monsters\">monster</a> would then attack the two, chasing them upstairs. Becca tripped and fell, giving the monster the time to catch up to her and cut her in half,<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC16&#95;2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC16-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> before eating her.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC9&#95;3-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC9-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>Her death would be covered up by <a href=\"/wiki/The_Order_of_St._George\" title=\"The Order of St. George\">The Order of St. George</a>, and the monster that killed her bound to <a href=\"/wiki/Octo\" title=\"Octo\">Octo</a>, Erica's <a href=\"/wiki/Totem\" title=\"Totem\">Totem</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearances\">Appearances</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Something_Is_Killing_the_Children\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something Is Killing the Children</a></i></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_9\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 9\">Issue #9</a> <small>(mentioned)</small></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_16\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 16\">Issue #16</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_17\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 17\">Issue #17</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_19\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 19\">Issue #19</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"628fbbaa26c0446e4fdbcc68a95f2ab2\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:127px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Becca-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:125px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Becca.png\" title=\"Becca.png (644 KB)\" style=\"height:125px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/c/c1/Becca.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20241229032547\" title=\"Becca.png (644 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Issue #16\" height=\"125\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Becca.png\" data-image-key=\"Becca.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Becca.png (644 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Issue #16\" height=\"125\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Becca.png\" data-image-key=\"Becca.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/c/c1/Becca.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20241229032547\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_16\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 16\">Issue #16</a></div></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span></h2>\n<small><div style=\"width:auto; max-height:190px; overflow:auto; padding-left:0.5em; padding-right:0.5em; border-top-left-radius:0.5em; border-bottom-left-radius:0.5em\">\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-SIKTC17-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-SIKTC17_1-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/James_Tynion_IV\" title=\"James Tynion IV\">Tynion, James IV</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something is Killing the Children</a>,</i> <a href=\"/wiki/Me_and_My_Monster_(comic_arc)\" title=\"Me and My Monster (comic arc)\">vol. #4</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_17\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 17\">issue no. 17</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Boom!_Studios\" title=\"Boom! Studios\">Boom! Studios</a>, 2021.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-SIKTC16-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-SIKTC16_2-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/James_T